# Dedicated LE Audio source fixture application Kconfig.
#
# All run-time options are standard Zephyr/Bluetooth symbols set in
# prj.conf and the board conf. The RH1A core modules compile without any
# application-specific Kconfig; diagnostic fixture options live below.

source "Kconfig.zephyr"

config HIL_SOURCE_QOS_RTN
	int "HIL source CIS retransmission number (RTN)"
	default 5
	range 0 5
	help
	  RTN used in the source BAP QoS presets. Default 5 matches the
	  original frozen presets (nse=6). Diagnostic-only knob: the
	  receiver transport investigation varies it in fragments; normal
	  builds must not set it.

config HIL_SOURCE_QOS_PHY
	int "HIL source CIS PHY (1 or 2)"
	default 2
	range 1 2
	help
	  PHY used in the source BAP QoS presets. Default 2 (2M) matches the
	  original frozen presets. Diagnostic-only knob for the receiver
	  transport investigation; normal builds must not set it.

config HIL_SOURCE_TX_OUTSTANDING_TARGET
	int "HIL source TX outstanding target per stream"
	default 3
	range 1 6
	help
	  Per-stream in-flight SDU cap for the completion-paced TX loop.
	  Default 3 matches the original source-fixture backpressure design.
	  Diagnostic-only knob for the receiver transport investigation;
	  normal builds must not set it.
